<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank offers bills Thurs, max yield 12.4%.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank offers bills Thurs, max yield 12.4%.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank will hold a Dutch auction offering five billion crowns ($175.4 million) in 13-week central bank liquidity bills on Thursday, with maximum gross yield on bids set at 12.4 percent, the CNB said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The maximum yield is unchanged from a similar auction of central bank bills last week.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003 ($ = 28.51 Czech Crowns)</p>
</text>
